{"agent":"fleet-mergequeue","data":{"fix_task":"fix-B86a970f727","item":"","scope":"ddflow","summary":"The pinsregen git merge driver (ddflow pins regenerate --install) keeps our side of the WHOLE pin file on any merge. For a mixed file such as README.md (prose plus generated tables, and [pins] lists it) that drops the other side's non-conflicting prose edits silently; the post-merge hook regenerates only the generated blocks, so the loss is not noticed. services/pins_merge.py merge_driver returns 0 leaving ours untouched. The merge queue's integrator now resolves only the conflicting hunks (git merge-file --ours); the driver should do the same: run git merge-file --ours %A %O %B with the three versions it is given.","title":"pinsregen merge driver drops the other side's prose edits in a mixed pin file (README.md)"},"id":"e5a611b62910888bb02a61ea6","kind":"bug.found","lamport":66956,"schema":1,"subject":"B86a970f727","ts":"2026-10-16T08:50:18.357782Z"}
{"agent":"fleet-mergequeue","data":{"body":"Fixes bug B86a970f727: The pinsregen git merge driver (ddflow pins regenerate --install) keeps our side of the WHOLE pin file on any merge. For a mixed file such as README.md (prose plus generated tables, and [pins] lists it) that drops the other side's non-conflicting prose edits silently; the post-merge hook regenerates only the generated blocks, so the loss is not noticed. services/pins_merge.py merge_driver returns 0 leaving ours untouched. The merge queue's integrator now resolves only the conflicting hunks (git merge-file --ours); the driver should do the same: run git merge-file --ours %A %O %B with the three versions it is given.\n\nWrite the regression test first and watch it FAIL on the unfixed code; then `ddflow complete fix-B86a970f727 --regression-test <test>` closes the bug with the task (or `ddflow bug fixed B86a970f727 --regression-test <test>` first).","fixes":["B86a970f727"],"globs":["ddflow/services/pins_merge.py","tests/test_pins_regenerate.py"],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"","priority":100,"tags":["bugfix"],"title":"Fix bug B86a970f727: pinsregen merge driver drops the other side's prose edits in a mixed pin file (README.md)"},"id":"e04955c29699595fd535cae9d","kind":"task.added","lamport":66957,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B86a970f727","ts":"2026-10-16T08:50:18.448087Z"}
